            "date": "2020-03-27T20:11:35Z"
          },
          "message": "feat: add goma hooks that can be invoked by CI (#129)\n\n* feat: add goma hooks that can be invoked by CI\r\n\r\nFollows up https://github.com/electron/electron/pull/22784 discussion:\r\nwe want CI to be able to use build-tools' goma utils in a way that\r\nwon't break if `utils/goma.js` ever gets refactored. So three new\r\ncommands have been added for CI to use:\r\n\r\n* `e show gomadir` (prints goma.dir)\r\n* `e show goma-gn-file` (prints goma.gnFilePath)\r\n* `e update-goma` (runs goma.downloadAndPrepare())\r\n\r\nIn addition, goma.downloadAndPrepare() now returns a checksum on\r\nsuccess so that `e update-goma` has something  to log on success.\r\nThis isn't essential (the exit code already shows success/failure)\r\nbut is visually nice.\r\n\r\n* refactor: consistency tweaks.\r\n\r\nRename `e show goma-gn-file` to `e show gomagn`",
          "tree": {
            "sha": "3b62f95accdf45fd740a74b65e0e19778a638b67",
            "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/discord/electron-build-tools/git/trees/3b62f95accdf45fd740a74b65e0e19778a638b67"
          },
          "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/discord/electron-build-tools/git/commits/3448263947d9cc782003858bb008df84d20847d4",
          "comment_count": 0,
          "verification": {
            "verified": true,
            "reason": "valid",
            "signature": "-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsBcBAABCAAQBQJefl33CRBK7hj4Ov3rIwAAdHIIAAWaeDu/mUu3NE7RePEucvx2\ny3PmgxhFIWFcAboWW8NF4MGasaXiWeYl+GHcdCo5BeuCUAMXN09VMR9RNbwagQ6Z\nTAqlRerjXM1X2dSWpydzV2/9GNZVe+ZTnjNbCXOfAz22S/M+MYfv6XqUKUdvimW4\no/lqb5wgzIv0gQZwJAI96p40OlfnWWNDycUDv3emNY+/xWeInPAhC6KO4FJtNVGt\npVVSOmwHJzfXp2s5a68aw6ypMjWieTpW1jAcIodp8g1jR8Ll1H5OSGEYG4bRkreJ\njNcxLdvu5/7WHWVGGVPJFlj/7WZCNJmoJlBrqldTbb06tc/SettXNz81634/tEI=\n=iRBv\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n",
            "payload": "tree 3b62f95accdf45fd740a74b65e0e19778a638b67\nparent 1f72aa002c6e40277985f1aa92018b126c11c8f4\nauthor Charles Kerr <ckerr@github.com> 1585339895 -0500\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1585339895 -0700\n\nfeat: add goma hooks that can be invoked by CI (#129)\n\n* feat: add goma hooks that can be invoked by CI\r\n\r\nFollows up https://github.com/electron/electron/pull/22784 discussion:\r\nwe want CI to be able to use build-tools' goma utils in a way that\r\nwon't break if `utils/goma.js` ever gets refactored. So three new\r\ncommands have been added for CI to use:\r\n\r\n* `e show gomadir` (prints goma.dir)\r\n* `e show goma-gn-file` (prints goma.gnFilePath)\r\n* `e update-goma` (runs goma.downloadAndPrepare())\r\n\r\nIn addition, goma.downloadAndPrepare() now returns a checksum on\r\nsuccess so that `e update-goma` has something  to log on success.\r\nThis isn't essential (the exit code already shows success/failure)\r\nbut is visually nice.\r\n\r\n* refactor: consistency tweaks.\r\n\r\nRename `e show goma-gn-file` to `e show gomagn`"
          }
        },
